{"id":69527,"date":"2025-11-02T14:50:10","date_gmt":"2025-11-02T13:50:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69527"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:52:04","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:52:04","slug":"louzantrail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/louzantrail\/","title":{"rendered":"Louzantrail 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Louzantrail 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Louzantrail 2027<\/strong> realiza-se nos dias <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">6 e 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong> (com abertura do secretariado a 5 de mar\u00e7o), marcando o aguardado regresso de uma das provas mais emblem\u00e1ticas do <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">trail running em Portugal<\/a> aos trilhos da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Serra da Lous\u00e3<\/strong>, no concelho da Lous\u00e3 (<a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-coimbra\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">distrito de Coimbra<\/a>). Organizado pela Sec\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail Running do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Montanha Clube<\/strong> com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal da Lous\u00e3, o evento volta a percorrer vales profundos, levadas, cumes t\u00e9cnicos e as hist\u00f3ricas <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Aldeias do Xisto<\/strong>, incluindo o regresso da m\u00edtica dist\u00e2ncia Ultra com passagem pela pitoresca aldeia dos Francos e pelo Talasnal.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo divide-se por dois dias de competi\u00e7\u00e3o com partidas no <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Pal\u00e1cio da Lous\u00e3 Boutique Hotel<\/strong> (Rua Visconde de Espinhal) e meta instalada no <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Parque Municipal de Exposi\u00e7\u00f5es M\u00e1rio Soares<\/strong> (Rua General Humberto Delgado). No s\u00e1bado (6 de mar\u00e7o, \u00e0s 08:00), arrancam o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">LZT Trail Ultra 48 km<\/strong> (3000 m D+, tempo limite de 10h30), o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">LZT Trail Longo 31 km<\/strong> (2100 m D+, limite de 7h00) e a 1\u00aa etapa do exigente <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">LZT By Stages (48 km + 20 km, 4100 m D+)<\/strong>, seguindo-se \u00e0 tarde (16:00) o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">LZT Trail Kids (Circuito Raposinhos)<\/strong>. No domingo (7 de mar\u00e7o), partem \u00e0s 09:00 o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">LZT Trail Curto 20 km<\/strong> (1100 m D+, limite de 5h00, integrado no Circuito Distrital de Trail Running da ADAC) e a 2\u00aa etapa do By Stages, encerrando \u00e0s 10:00 com o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">LZT Mini Trail XS \/ Caminhada de 14 km<\/strong> (700 m D+, limite de 4h00).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em tr\u00eas fases oficiais at\u00e9 <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">24 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong> (1\u00aa fase at\u00e9 30 de novembro de 2026; 2\u00aa fase de 1 de dezembro a 15 de janeiro de 2027; 3\u00aa fase de 16 de janeiro a 24 de fevereiro de 2027), existindo ainda 40 vagas de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Dorsal Solid\u00e1rio<\/strong> (donativo m\u00ednimo de 100\u20ac) e inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita para o Trail Kids. Todas as dist\u00e2ncias decorrem em regime de semi-autossufici\u00eancia com controlo eletr\u00f3nico por chip e exigem material obrigat\u00f3rio (dorsal, apito, corta-vento, telem\u00f3vel operacional e manta t\u00e9rmica 140\u00d7200 cm em todas as provas, acrescidos de reservat\u00f3rio de 1 litro no Longo e Ultra, e imperme\u00e1vel e frontal no Ultra 48 km). Planeia a tua gest\u00e3o de esfor\u00e7o e passagens nas barreiras hor\u00e1rias das Letras (km 10,6), For\u00e7as Armadas (km 18,5) e Lagar Mirita (km 35) com a nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; 