1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 30\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/12 a 15\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 35\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/01 a 24\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Mini Trail \/ Caminhada (Grau XXS)<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">LZT \u2013 Mini Trail XS \/ Caminhada 14 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 7 Mar (Dom) \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 700m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 20\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 25\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/12 a 15\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 30\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/01 a 24\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Jovem (Benjamins A e B)<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">LZT \u2013 Trail Kids (Circuito Raposinhos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 6 Mar (S\u00e1b) \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o:<\/strong> Gratuito<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 24\/02\/2027 (40 vagas))<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Louzantrail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Louzantrail 2027 realiza-se nos dias 6 e 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027 (com abertura do secretariado na sexta-feira, 5 de mar\u00e7o), na Vila da Lous\u00e3 e nos trilhos da Serra da Lous\u00e3 (distrito de Coimbra). As partidas de todas as provas competitivas t\u00eam lugar no Pal\u00e1cio da Lous\u00e3 Boutique Hotel (Rua Visconde de Espinhal) e as chegadas, o secretariado, a ExpoLZT e o circuito Trail Kids decorrem no Parque Municipal de Exposi\u00e7\u00f5es M\u00e1rio Soares (Rua General Humberto Delgado).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, hor\u00e1rios de partida e desn\u00edveis do Louzantrail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No s\u00e1bado, 6 de mar\u00e7o, partem \u00e0s 08:00 o LZT Trail Ultra de 48 km (3000 m D+), o LZT Trail Longo de 31 km (2100 m D+) e a 1\u00aa etapa do LZT By Stages (48 km + 20 km, totalizando 68 km e 4100 m D+), realizando-se \u00e0s 16:00 o LZT Trail Kids (Circuito Raposinhos). No domingo, 7 de mar\u00e7o, partem \u00e0s 09:00 o LZT Trail Curto de 20 km (1100 m D+, integrado no Circuito Distrital da ADAC) e a 2\u00aa etapa do By Stages, e \u00e0s 10:00 o LZT Mini Trail XS \/ Caminhada de 14 km (700 m D+).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Louzantrail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em 3 fases: Fase 1 (1 de outubro a 30 de novembro de 2026), Fase 2 (1 de dezembro de 2026 a 15 de janeiro de 2027) e Fase 3 (16 de janeiro a 24 de fevereiro de 2027). Os valores s\u00e3o: By Stages (60\u20ac \/ 65\u20ac \/ 70\u20ac), Trail Ultra 48 km (50\u20ac \/ 55\u20ac \/ 60\u20ac, 250 vagas), Trail Longo 31 km (30\u20ac \/ 35\u20ac \/ 40\u20ac, 450 vagas), Trail Curto 20 km (25\u20ac \/ 30\u20ac \/ 35\u20ac, 450 vagas, com 1,50\u20ac de desconto para filiados FPA\/ADAC), Mini Trail XS 14 km (20\u20ac \/ 25\u20ac \/ 30\u20ac, 250 vagas) e Trail Kids (Gratuito, 40 vagas). A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, seguro, pr\u00e9mio Finisher, abastecimentos, banhos e mini refei\u00e7\u00e3o final.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os tempos limite (cut-offs) e barreiras hor\u00e1rias de cada prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Ultra 48 km tem um tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 10h30 (fecho de meta \u00e0s 18:30), com barreiras hor\u00e1rias nas Letras ao km 10,6 (11:30 \/ 3h30), For\u00e7as Armadas ao km 18,5 (13:30 \/ 5h30) e Lagar Mirita ao km 35 (16:00 \/ 8h00). O Trail Longo 31 km tem limite de 7h00 (meta \u00e0s 15:00; barreiras \u00e0s 11:30 nas Letras e 13:30 nas For\u00e7as Armadas). O Trail Curto 20 km tem limite de 5h00 (meta \u00e0s 14:00; barreira \u00e0s 12:30 nas Letras) e o Mini Trail XS 14 km tem um tempo m\u00e1ximo de 4h00 (meta \u00e0s 14:00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido e onde funciona o secretariado?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Em todas as dist\u00e2ncias \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, apito, corta-vento, telem\u00f3vel operacional e manta t\u00e9rmica (140\u00d7200 cm). No Trail Longo 31 km e no Ultra 48 km acresce a obrigatoriedade de reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua com capacidade m\u00ednima de 1 litro, sendo no Ultra 48 km tamb\u00e9m obrigat\u00f3rios o casaco imperme\u00e1vel e a luz frontal. Como n\u00e3o h\u00e1 copos descart\u00e1veis nos abastecimentos, cada atleta deve levar o seu copo reutiliz\u00e1vel. O secretariado funciona no Parque Municipal de Exposi\u00e7\u00f5es M\u00e1rio Soares na sexta-feira (19:00\u201321:00), no s\u00e1bado (06:30\u201310:00 e 18:00\u201320:00) e no domingo (07:30\u201309:45).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Louzantrail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-06\", \"endDate\": \"2027-03-06\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Lous\u00e3, Coimbra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lous\u00e3\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Louzantrail 2027 realiza-se a 6 e 7 de mar\u00e7o na Serra da Lous\u00e3 (Coimbra), com provas de 48 km, 31 km, 20 km e 14 km. Consulta o regulamento e inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/1